OL,3,CUK records hottest day of the year as
OL,4,Ctemperatures top 38C
OL,6,FThursday was the UK's hottest day of
OL,7,Fthe year so far, as temperatures
OL,8,Fsoared to more than 38C in London.
OL,10,FKew Gardens recorded a top temperature
OL,11,Fof 38.1C, surpassing the previous high
OL,12,Fof 38C on June 28, the Met Office said.
OL,14,FThis makes it the fifth hottest day on
OL,15,Frecord, and also extends 2026's record-
OL,16,Fbreaking run of days above 35C.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
