OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786673923
OL,3,CUK records hottest day of the year as
OL,4,Ctemperatures top 38C
OL,6,FEarlier on Thursday, the Met Office
OL,7,Fsaid temperatures had reached 37.6C at
OL,8,FCharlwood in Surrey, while at Wisley
OL,9,Ftemperatures had hit 37.2C, and Kew
OL,10,FGardens in London had recorded a
OL,11,Ftemperature of 37C.
OL,13,FAmber warnings for "extreme heat" are
OL,14,Fin place for a swathe of England from
OL,15,FLondon to Sheffield, parts of Cheshire
OL,16,Fand Greater Manchester, into
OL,17,FGloucestershire and Wiltshire in the
OL,18,FSouth West and Shropshire and
OL,19,FHerefordshire in the west.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
