FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786673923
OL,3,CUK records hottest day of the year as
OL,4,Ctemperatures top 38C
OL,6,FThe Met Office warned the highest
OL,7,Ftemperatures on Thursday are expected
OL,8,Fin parts of the Midlands and western
OL,9,FEngland.
OL,11,FAmber heat health alerts are also in
OL,12,Fplace for most of England until
OL,13,FFriday, with officials urging people
OL,14,Fto take simple precautions such as
OL,15,Fstaying out of the sun at the hottest
OL,16,Fpart of the day, checking in on
OL,17,Fvulnerable friends and family and
OL,18,Fstaying hydrated.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
