OL,3,CUK records hottest day of the year as
OL,4,Ctemperatures top 38C
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThe UK is facing increasingly extreme
OL,12,Fconditions such as heatwaves, drought
OL,13,Fand wildfires fuelled by climate
OL,14,Fchange, which is mostly driven by
OL,15,Fgreenhouse gas emissions from burning
OL,16,Ffossil fuels for power plants,
OL,17,Fvehicles, heating and industry.
OL,19,FWhen will the UK see rain again?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
