CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786673923
OL,3,CUK records hottest day of the year as
OL,4,Ctemperatures top 38C
OL,6,FA yellow warning has been issued for
OL,7,Fthunderstorms in Northern Ireland,
OL,8,Fwhich is in place until 6am on Friday.
OL,10,FOn Friday, into the evening and
OL,11,Fovernight, outbreaks of rain and
OL,12,Flonger downpours will develop and
OL,13,Fslide south and eastwards. Ahead of
OL,14,Fthis, there is the chance of
OL,15,Fthunderstorms developing across parts
OL,16,Fof England and Wales where the rain is
OL,17,Fmuch needed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
