FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786673923
OL,3,CUK records hottest day of the year as
OL,4,Ctemperatures top 38C
OL,6,FIn heavier downpours, the rain will
OL,7,Fstruggle to infiltrate into the ground
OL,8,Fas it's been hardened by weeks of
OL,9,Fstrong sunshine and heat, so expect
OL,10,Fexcess surface water.
OL,12,FWhat problems is the extreme heat
OL,13,Fcausing?
OL,15,FBaroness Brown, who chairs the
OL,16,Findependent advisory Climate Change
OL,17,FCommittee's adaptation work, warned it
OL,18,F"gets worse from here" until
OL,19,Fgreenhouse gas emissions are cut to
OL,20,Fzero overall, known as net zero.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
