PN,31107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786673923
OL,3,CUK records hottest day of the year as
OL,4,Ctemperatures top 38C
OL,6,FClimate advisers are also urging the
OL,7,Fgovernment to take steps to prepare
OL,8,Fthe UK for worsening extremes, from
OL,9,Fmaking it easier for farmers to build
OL,10,Freservoirs to putting air conditioning
OL,11,Fin hospitals and providing grants for
OL,12,Fvulnerable families to do the same.
OL,14,FWith record dry conditions in July and
OL,15,Fa dry start to August, nearly three
OL,16,Fquarters of England and the whole of
OL,17,FWales are in drought, heaping pressure
OL,18,Fon water resources for households,
OL,19,Fagriculture and the environment.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
