OL,3,CUK records hottest day of the year as
OL,4,Ctemperatures top 38C
OL,6,FEngland and Wales have already seen as
OL,7,Fmany wildfires this year as during the
OL,8,Fwhole of 2025.
OL,10,FSome 1,017 wildfires have been
OL,11,Frecorded in England and Wales this
OL,12,Fyear, according to data shared by the
OL,13,FNational Fire Chiefs Council (NFCC),
OL,14,Fthe same as last year's record-
OL,15,Fbreaking total.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
