OL,3,CUK records hottest day of the year as
OL,4,Ctemperatures top 38C
OL,6,FCrews from the Hampshire and Isle of
OL,7,FWight Fire and Rescue Service have
OL,8,Fcontinued battling a blaze which hit
OL,9,Fprotected heathland in the New Forest
OL,10,Fafter a van caught fire on the A31
OL,11,Fnear Ringwood on Sunday.
OL,13,FIn a statement on Thursday morning,
OL,14,Fthe service said: "Once again
OL,15,Ffirefighters have been working through
OL,16,Fthe night at the scene of the New
OL,17,FForest wildfire."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786673923
OL,3,CUK records hottest day of the year as
OL,4,Ctemperatures top 38C
OL,6,FAlong with colleagues from other fire
OL,7,Fservices, crews have been using
OL,8,Ftechniques including mulching, tree
OL,9,Ffelling and "backburning", controlled
OL,10,Fburning to create firebreaks, the
OL,11,Fstatement said.
OL,13,F"Our teams continue to make good
OL,14,Fprogress, but we still expect to be on
OL,15,Fthe scene for the next few days, with
OL,16,Fthe A31 remaining closed," the service
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/10
